---
title: "Shei Tumi"
artist: "Tumi"
key: "C"
tags: ["english"]
---

[C]shei tumi keno eto ochena hole

[C]shei ami keno tomake [G]dukkho dilem

[C]kemon kore eto ochena hole tumi

[C]kibhabe eto bodle gechi [G]ei ami

O [C]bukeri shob [Em]koshto du hate [Am]shoriye cholo [Dm]bodle jai

tumi keno [F]bojhona [Dm]tomake chara ami [G]oshohai

amar [C]shob tuku [E]bhalobasha [Am]tomai niye

amar [Dm]oporadh [F]chilo joto tuku [Dm]tomar kache

tumi [C]khoma kore [Em]dio [C]amai…

[C]kotorat ami [Em]kedechi [Am]buker govire [C]koshto niye

[C]shunnotai dube [Em]gechi ami [Am]amake tumi firi [C]ye nao

tumi keno [F]bojhona [Dm]tomake chara ami [G]oshohai

amar [C]shob tuku [E]bhalobasha [Am]tomai niye

amar [Dm]oporadh [F]chilo joto tuku [Dm]tomar kache

tumi [C]khoma kore [Em]dio [C]amai…

[C]jotobar bhebechi [Em]bhule jabo [Am]aro beshi mone [C]pore jai

[C]fele asha shei shob [Em]din gulo [Am]bhule jete ami [C]parina.

Rest are same
